 "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-23T16:50:28Z", "username": "Abhishek Vats", "text": "5. For the mission X in 1965, the commander, Gus Grissom, was still haunted by his previous mission, Liberty Bell 7, which had sunk into the Atlantic after splashdown. To make a point, he nicknamed the X capsule \"Molly Brown,\" after the popular Broadway musical The Unsinkable Molly Brown.\nNASA officials, who preferred more serious names, weren't amused. When they told him to change it, Grissom reportedly suggested \"Titanic\" as his second choice. NASA relented and let him keep \"Molly Brown,\" though it was the last time an astronaut was allowed to officially name their own spacecraft for several years.  Id X.", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-23T16:50:34Z", "username": "Khandoba", "text": "He has inaugurated 50 universities over last 2k years", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-23T16:50:36Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "apollo", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-23T16:50:44Z", "username": "Kartikey Pradhan", "text": "gemini", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-23T16:50:45Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "mercury", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-23T16:50:48Z", "username": "Kartikey Pradhan", "text": "titanic expedition", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-23T16:50:58Z", "username": "Saumay", "text": "Gemini 3", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-23T16:50:59Z", "username": "Abhishek Vats", "text": "Will give it Gemini III", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "20